 leadership experience.&nbsp; She possesses deep expertise in event marketing strategy, design, planning, and management.&nbsp; Sharon has a wealth of industry knowledge as well as strong program and people management skills supporting a variety of industries including high-tech, banking, and non-profit organizations. She has built her success by focusing on the customer experience with a highly effective collaborative and influential relationship-building approach.&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:14px;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:futura-lt-w01-book,futura-lt-w05-book,sans-serif;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Sharon's global expertise is with large and small-scale conferences, executive (high-touch) events, sales incentive programs, trade shows, award ceremonies, meetings, and events. From a 9,500-person customer conference to an executive dinner in the Tower of London to a 5-day custom wine country retreat, to a&nbsp; 2,000-person private concert - she has had the pleasure of designing and creating many memorable events!&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:14px;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:futura-lt-w01-book,futura-lt-w05-book,sans-serif;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Sharon holds a B.S. in Psychology as well as her Certificate of Meeting Manager Designation.&nbsp; She currently serves on the board of advisors for Market Ready Index, a one-of-a-kind marketing assessment tool dedicated to identifying marketing program effectiveness.&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:14px;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:futura-lt-w01-book,futura-lt-w05-book,sans-serif;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"